# CAUTION: fixture for CHG-001 AC-1.1~1.4 (multi-alias parsing)
# 一个块服务三个别名：删除粒度应为整块，展示应含全部三个名字
Host alpha beta gamma
    HostName multi.example.com
    User u1
    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_alpha

Host single
    HostName single.example.com
    User u2
    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_single
